WEBVTT

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:35.150
Tae Nee-chan?

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:39.030
Are you all right?

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:40.770
Y-Yes.

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:42.040
I'm all right.

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:45.620
I was cleaning the bath, and I just slipped a little.

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:49.940
Oh, Tae Nee-chan, what are you doing?

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:05.780
T-Taeko-chan!

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.060
Oh, no!

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:24.610
Good night.

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:26.180
Thank you for the hard work.

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:27.200
Good night.

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:17.000
What's that sound?

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.100
W-Wait...

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:23.140
What?

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.220
What is it?

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.820
Yeah, it's delicious!

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:45.830
Yeah. Indeed, Aoi-chan's box lunches are great.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.490
Today, specially, this broiled yellowtail...

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:52.030
What's wrong, Tina?

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:53.800
You've been yawning since a while ago.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.040
Are you not getting enough sleep?

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:58.840
W-Well, kind of.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.840
I'm sure you stayed up late playing games, right?

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:04.710
So you've shown up, brat.

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:05.750
You're wrong.

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:07.310
I wasn't playing games.

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:09.850
Then, what were you doing?

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:10.390
Eh!

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.350
T-That is...

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.660
See? She can't say.

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:19.070
Which means you were playing games, after all.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:24.500
If I say I was so scared of that
eerie sound I couldn't sleep,

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:27.130
I don't know what this brat might say.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:30.840
Hey, Kaoru, Tae-chin.

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:33.750
Last night, did you hear any strange sounds?

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:34.830
Sounds?

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:39.210
I was fast asleep, so I didn't notice anything, though.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:40.340
Me, either.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.050
I see.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:45.480
Ah, speaking of fast asleep, Senpai, I'm sorry.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:46.290
Eh!

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:50.140
It looks like Chika-chan crawled
into your futon again this morning.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:51.060
Heh!

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:54.030
Ah, I don't mind.

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:55.900
I'm actually used to it now.

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:57.440
W-Wait.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:00.630
What do you mean, Hanabishi-sama?

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:02.740
The same futon as that girl?

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:07.370
Chika-chan sometimes
crawls into my futon half asleep.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:10.910
And when I wake up, we're often sleeping together.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.000
What did you say?

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:17.680
There's no need to get in such an uproar about it.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:19.310
It's Chika-rin, after all.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:22.220
I'm sorry, Hanabishi-sama.

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:26.260
I just remembered something
I have to do, so excuse me.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.460
Farewell.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.150
Ah, Mayu-chan!

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.000
I never knew.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:37.370
There was so special a privilege
to living with Hanabishi-sama!

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:39.570
Ah, how envious I'm!

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:43.580
I can't let this stand.

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:47.440
I will get my chance to sleep with Hanabishi-sama!

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:56.550
I-I'm sorry.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:02.210
Wait!

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.010
No!

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:14.900
Next time, please be sure to take enough care.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:19.080
Yes, I'm very sorry.

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:20.240
Good night.

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:28.520
What the heck am I doing?

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:30.150
I'm just no good.

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:30.910
Ah!

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:34.930
Uzume, did you catch another bug?

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:36.620
If Miyabi-san sees that...

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:37.620
Heh!

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:41.830
This is a key?

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:44.850
Uzume, where did you find this?

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.050
Ah!

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:49.100
I wonder what this key is for.

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:02.060
What? Was it a dream?

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.910
Kaoru!

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:15.030
W-What's wrong, Tina?

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:17.940
You see... You see...

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:19.770
A ghost{monster} appeared!

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:21.140
A ghost{monster}?

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.710
A strange noise is coming from the attic!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:26.150
I'm sure that it's a ghost{monster}!

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:27.210
Hey, now...

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.300
I'm scared!

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:31.220
Kaoru, I'm scared!

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.220
H-Hold on, Tina!

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:34.510
I'll sleep with you! I'll sleep with you, Kaoru!

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:34.510
D-Dummy!

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:35.930
Hey, you!

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:37.980
No!

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.850
A ghost{monster}?!

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:48.200
Right. A strange noise came
from the attic during the night!

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:50.840
It just has to be some ghost{monster}'s work!

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:53.510
Even so, I don't think it's a ghost{monster}.

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:55.660
I heard that sound, too.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:56.240
Heh?!

00:07:56.810 --> 00:08:00.870
I have also heard sounds coming
from the attic from time to time.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:02.950
That's it.

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:05.990
I'm sure that's where the
ghosts{monsters} are coming and going.

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:06.950
Come on.

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:10.260
In that case, please leave it to me.

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:11.760
That's right.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:14.930
If you're dealing with ghosts{monsters},
then it's the expert's turn.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.800
Tae-chin, please take care of it.

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:19.600
Okay, I understood.

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.560
Then, let's all go exterminate them.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.140
T-Together?

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:24.140
Yes!

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:25.480
Oh, it hurts.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.470
M-My stomach suddenly...

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:29.440
Oh, it hurts.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.300
It's no use, Tina-senpai.

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:32.910
Tch!

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:34.700
You brought all of this up.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:38.160
No! I don't like scary things!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:46.630
This is the door that leads to the attic, right?

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:50.560
Huh? It won't open.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:52.180
That door won't open.

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:53.550
Eh, why is that?

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.740
The key has been missing a long time,

00:08:56.740 --> 00:09:00.850
and it has become known as
<i>the room that can't be opened.</i>

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:04.210
Of course, it could be if we called a locksmith, though.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:07.280
But, with no special need, it was left like this.

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:09.250
Huh? This shape...

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:10.320
Could it be...

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:14.520
So the ghost{monster} exterminating
will have to wait till next time.

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:17.090
Well, Tae-chin! it's too bad!

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:19.910
But we can't get in, so it can't be helped.

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.900
But then the ghosts{monsters} are still in there.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:23.130
Heh!

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:24.960
I don't want that, either!

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:26.800
Ah!

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:28.460
Huh, it opened.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:31.920
Well, let's do our best, everyone!

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:45.050
Um, Taeko-san.

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:46.640
We're ready now, but...

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:49.940
Wow! you look great, everyone!

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:55.690
Taeko-chan, why do we have to wear these outfits?

00:09:55.690 --> 00:10:00.450
Senpai, at times like these,
you have to look the part first.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.970
All right, good luck, Tae-chin!

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:06.140
I'll do my best taking care of the phones!

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:07.690
Tina-senpai.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:10.710
Tae-chin is being mean to me.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.450
But Miyabi-san, too?

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:16.620
I am the manager of this house.

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:20.550
I cannot simply stand by
during such a serious happening.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:23.760
All right, everyone, do you have your salt?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.520
Salt?

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.960
Salt has the power to drive out spirits.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:30.230
So, please make sure to carry some.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:33.070
Yeah, there's no way I'm letting go of it.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.290
O-One sack should be enough, though.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.900
By the way, everyone, please be careful.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:44.790
I've put up seals and traps all over the mansion to prevent the ghosts{monsters} from running away.

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:49.480
So, please don't just go off
on your own since it's dangerous.

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:51.380
Besides... Ah!

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:53.090
Please wait a moment.

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:54.540
O-Okay.

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:09.170
Um, Kaoru-sama.

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:11.000
May I hold your hand?

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:12.470
Sure. Ah!

00:11:12.470 --> 00:11:15.020
K-Kaoru, can I, too?

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:15.650
Sure.

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:16.940
{Big Brother}Onii-chan!

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:28.550
Huh?

00:11:28.550 --> 00:11:30.290
What's going on, everyone?

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:32.260
T-T-T-T-Taeko-chan...

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:33.560
{T-T-The power's...}E-E-Electricity is...

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:34.590
Yes.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:37.630
This makes it easier to see the spirits.

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:38.840
We don't want to see them!

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:42.130
Well, let's go, everyone.

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:47.970
There is nothing that girl is
allowed to do that I am not, right?

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:50.540
Please wait, Hanabishi-sama.

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:54.770
Tonight, let's have sweet
and romantic dreams together.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:43.200
W-Well, Taeko-chan?

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:46.130
There seems to be a lot of things in here.

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:51.970
I heard that this attic was used as a storage area.

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:57.420
Items that were unused or could not
be thrown away were stored up here.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:01.810
The history of this house is up here, isn't it?

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:03.170
Ah!

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:07.220
What's that?

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:09.580
Heh? W-What?

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:17.150
Here it comes!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:21.870
It's a mannequin.

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:23.470
A mannequin.

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:24.860
See?

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.010
T-That was a shock.

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:30.480
I thought that my heart was going to stop.

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:32.160
Mine did stop a moment.

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:35.780
You're all making such a big deal out of this.

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:37.270
Well, let's go.

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:53.060
Tae, you're doing this on purpose, aren't you?

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.890
You have to be!

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:56.700
Eh, what?

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:01.110
There are so many old things.

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:05.360
I wonder what they used these for?

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:14.540
Is anybody home?

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:16.460
Could they be away?

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:18.320
This is strange.

00:14:18.320 --> 00:14:22.120
Hanabishi-sama isn't in the other
building, or the others, either.

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:26.890
W-What is that?

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.270
Chika-rin, wait!

00:14:34.210 --> 00:14:37.340
W-W-W-W-Why are there bones in here?

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:38.350
Huh?

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:43.610
This is just a model skeleton.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:44.320
Heh!

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:46.950
You're right.

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:49.420
It's written <i>Sakuraba Science.</i>

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:52.780
The Sakuraba Group even makes these.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.230
A-Are you all right, Aoi-sama?

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:03.570
Yes, somehow.

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:05.840
Please do not worry, Aoi-sama.

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:10.880
I, Miyabi Kagurazaki, will protect
you, even if I must lose my life!

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:13.880
We can't do anything in this darkness.

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:16.350
For now, let's go and turn the lights on.

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:17.580
Y-Yes.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:21.650
I wonder if Kaoru-sama is all right.

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:22.520
Aoi-sama.

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:23.060
Ah!

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.230
Anyone?

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:28.400
Is anyone there?

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:33.200
Hanabishi-sama!

00:15:34.380 --> 00:15:35.240
Ah!

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:40.750
What in the world is this?

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:44.290
Oh, this is so annoying.

00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:49.050
Heh?!

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:50.670
Heh?!

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:53.150
What?

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:55.550
What's happening?

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:00.560
What? What?

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:08.670
Y-You've come out, ghost{monster}.

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:11.770
I won't let you lay a single finger on Aoi-sama!

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:16.530
What in the world is this paper?

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:28.450
Senpai, it's a dead end.

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:31.720
As we searched farthest part and
we didn't find anything, means...

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:36.260
indeed, the source of the sounds wasn't a ghost{monster}.

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:37.420
No way!

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:49.010
It's a pretty old picture.

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:51.890
Oh, this is the Sakuraba house.

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:58.620
Which means all these people
worked here a long time ago.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:16:59.920
It looks like it.

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:06.630
This is...

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:08.060
Heh?!

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:10.460
I'm scared. I'm scared.

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:12.590
Tina Nee-chan, calm down!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:13.840
Tina Nee-chan!

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:16.390
Chika-rin, I'm scared! I'm scared!

00:17:19.610 --> 00:17:21.540
W-What was that just now?

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.310
Stop!

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:26.510
Is this a sports meet?

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:27.650
I'm scared.

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:38.160
That maid looks a little like you, Taeko-chan.

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:40.820
Yeah, she really does.

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:45.120
It looks like it fell from here.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:50.440
I wonder if this person was also a klutzy maid.

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:53.070
Maybe, she does look like you.

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:54.840
Senpai, that's mean!

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:57.780
I'm kidding.

00:17:57.780 --> 00:18:02.520
You're so earnest, and you're
always doing your best, right?

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:04.270
I'm sure this maid was, too.

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:08.730
Senpai?

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:11.420
Ah, um...

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:13.760
Well, um...

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:14.690
What is it?

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:17.950
Actually... Actually, I...

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.600
Heh, H-Here it appeared!

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.910
Senpai, please stand back!

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:41.090
Rin! Pyo! Tou! Sha! Kai! Jin! Retsu! Zai!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:42.940
Zen!

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:20.880
Uzume!

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:23.390
U-Uzume?

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:27.390
Stop!

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:31.240
No!

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:32.830
What in the world is this?

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:40.950
It looks like the ghost{monster} was actually Uzume.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:45.410
When night fell, he snuck
in here and played around.

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:48.490
Shall we go back?

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:49.820
Yes.

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:51.120
Uzume, you're coming, too.

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:07.350
Huh?

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:24.420
I guess this will work.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:38.770
This was really all your work, wasn't it?

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:47.450
You wanted to be with him.

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:50.140
Next to the beloved one.

00:22:36.520 --> 00:22:38.970
I have a date with
Hanabishi-sama!

00:22:38.970 --> 00:22:40.980
What? Don't get so close to him!

00:22:40.980 --> 00:22:42.500
He'll be stunned by my dressing look:

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:43.960
<i>You're beautiful today.</i>

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:45.460
<i>Huh, it's no good!</i>

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:48.470
<i>Why did it turn like this, in heaven?!</i>

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:49.380
Hey...

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:53.600
And then our honeyed, sweet, sugary life will begin.

00:22:53.240 --> 00:22:54.600
Um...

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:56.780
This is good, really good!

00:22:56.780 --> 00:22:59.600
Next time, Ai Yori Aoshi Enishi,

